        "statement": "For example, in 2023, we acquired HCC Group to expand our automotive wireless business, in 2024, we acquired Infineon Group’s manufacturing subsidiaries in the Philippines and South Korea to expand power chip module packaging and testing and lead frame packaging, and in March 2026, the board of directors of ASE Malaysia resolved to acquire Analog Devices’s manufacturing subsidiaries in Malaysia to enhance supply chain resilience and manufacturing diversity.",
