        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For information on the aggregate capacity of our facilities we operate, see “—Business Overview—Equipment.” For administrative actions and judicial proceedings related to Kaohsiung Facility, see “Item 8.",
