        "filing_date": "2026-04-01",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, as a turnkey service provider, we are able to offer our products to our customers and complementary service providers within relatively close geographic proximity.",
        "start_character": 20965,
        "end_character": 21141
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-135585",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-135585-daf81bc38ec546bf",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-135585",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since 1997, we have maintained a strategic alliance with TSMC, which designates us as their non-exclusive preferred provider of packaging and testing services for semiconductors manufactured by TSMC.",
        "start_character": 23011,
        "end_character": 23210
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-135585",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-135585-daf81bc38ec546bf",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-135585",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-01",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our strategic alliance with and close geographic proximity to TSMC, we are able to offer our customers a total semiconductor manufacturing solution that includes access to foundry services in addition to our packaging, testing, and direct shipment services.",
        "start_character": 23211,
        "end_character": 23476
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-135585",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-135585-daf81bc38ec546bf",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-135585",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-01",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer module assembly services, which combine one or more packaged semiconductors with other components in an integrated module to enable increased functionality for system-level assembly.",
